# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (U+2014) anywhere on this site: page copy, bios, blogs, listings, alt text, meta, comments, or commit messages.

It reads as AI-generated. Write like a person.

Use a comma, a period, a colon, or a spaced hyphen (` - `) instead.

```
# BAD
That hands-on background is what I bring to every property I manage — keeping luxury homes in excellent shape.

# GOOD
That hands-on background is what I bring to every property I manage, keeping luxury homes in excellent shape.
```

```
# BAD
Use the arrows to browse — or see every review on Airbnb.

# GOOD
Use the arrows to browse, or see every review on Airbnb.
```

Do not use en dashes (U+2013) as a substitute for the same pause.
